    <statement><p>For the function <m>f(x)=2 e^{x}</m> and <m>g(x)=x^{4}</m>, find the following:</p>
<p><alert>(a)</alert> 
<m>f(g(1))</m>= <fillin characters="35" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
<p><alert>(b)</alert> 
<m>g(f(1))</m>= <fillin characters="35" name="AnSwEr0002"/></p>
<p><alert>(c)</alert> 
<m>f(g(x))</m>= <fillin characters="35" name="AnSwEr0003"/></p>
<p><alert>(d)</alert> 
<m>g(f(x))</m>= <fillin characters="35" name="AnSwEr0004"/></p>
<p><alert>(e)</alert> 
<m>f(t)g(t)</m>= <fillin characters="35" name="AnSwEr0005"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>2e</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\left(2e\right)^{4}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>2e^{x^{4}}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\left(2e^{x}\right)^{4}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>2e^{t}t^{4}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <solution><alert>(a)</alert>
<m>f(g(1))=f(1^{4})=2 e^{(1^{4})}</m>



<alert>(b)</alert>
<m>g(f(1))=g(2 e^{1})=(2 e^{1})^{4}</m>



<alert>(c)</alert>
<m>f(g(x))=f(x^{4})=2 e^{(x^{4})}</m>



<alert>(d)</alert>
<m>g(f(x))=g(2 e^{x})=(2 e^{x})^{4}</m>



<alert>(e)</alert>
<m>f(t)g(t)=2 e^{t} t^{4}</m>



</solution>
